   "html": "<section class=\"c-agenda-slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Today, 60 minutes</div>\n      <h2>Agenda</h2>\n      <p class=\"sub\">We are at item 3.</p>\n    </div>\n    <ol>\n      <li><span class=\"n\">01</span><span class=\"t\">Where we are today</span><span class=\"d\">10 min</span></li>\n      <li><span class=\"n\">02</span><span class=\"t\">What customers told us</span><span class=\"d\">10 min</span></li>\n      <li class=\"is-current\" aria-current=\"step\"><span class=\"n\">03</span><span class=\"t\">Three growth options</span><span class=\"d\">20 min</span></li>\n      <li><span class=\"n\">04</span><span class=\"t\">Economics and risks</span><span class=\"d\">10 min</span></li>\n      <li><span class=\"n\">05</span><span class=\"t\">Decision and next steps</span><span class=\"d\">10 min</span></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-agenda-slide {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-agenda-slide .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 26cqi minmax(0, 1fr);\n  column-gap: 8cqi;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 6cqi 7cqi;\n}\n.c-agenda-slide .head { display: grid; gap: 1.4cqi; align-self: start; padding-top: 3cqi; }\n.c-agenda-slide .eyebrow { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-agenda-slide h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 5cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-agenda-slide .sub { margin: 0; font-size: 1.8cqi; line-height: 1.45; }\n.c-agenda-slide ol { display: grid; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-agenda-slide li {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 6cqi minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 2.1cqi 2cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-left: var(--ds-stroke) solid transparent;\n  border-right: var(--ds-stroke) solid transparent;\n  font-size: 2.3cqi;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n.c-agenda-slide li:last-child { border-bottom: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-agenda-slide .n {\n  font-size: 1.7cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.c-agenda-slide .t { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-agenda-slide .d { font-size: 1.6cqi; color: var(--ds-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-agenda-slide li.is-current {\n  background: var(--ds-highlight-fill);\n  border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  border-bottom: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  border-radius: calc(0.9cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1));\n}\n.c-agenda-slide li.is-current + li { border-top-color: transparent; }\n.c-agenda-slide li.is-current .n,\n.c-agenda-slide li.is-current .d { color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-agenda-slide li.is-current .t { color: var(--ds-ink); font-weight: 800; }",
