   "html": "<section class=\"c-big-number-slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">Onboarding</div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">62<span>%</span></div>\n      <p class=\"context\">of new accounts that stop using the product do so <b>within the first three screens</b>, before they ever see a result.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">Source: internal product analytics, January to September 2026, 48,200 new accounts.</div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
