   "html": "<section class=\"c-closing-slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"decision\">\n      <div class=\"label\">Decision we need</div>\n      <h2>Approve EUR&nbsp;0.6m to launch Option B in January</h2>\n      <p class=\"why\">It is the fastest route to market, and the contract can be exited after the first year.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right\">\n      <div class=\"steps-head\">Next steps</div>\n      <ol class=\"steps\">\n        <li><span class=\"n\">1</span><div class=\"what\"><b>Sign the reseller agreement</b><span>Head of Partnerships</span></div><span class=\"when\">7 Nov</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">2</span><div class=\"what\"><b>Release the pilot budget</b><span>Finance lead</span></div><span class=\"when\">21 Nov</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">3</span><div class=\"what\"><b>Onboard the first ten accounts</b><span>Product lead</span></div><span class=\"when\">5 Dec</span></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">Questions before Friday: <b>strategy@example.com</b></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-closing-slide {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-closing-slide .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);\n  grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  column-gap: 5cqi;\n  padding: 6cqi 7cqi 4.5cqi;\n}\n.c-closing-slide .decision {\n  align-self: center;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 1.8cqi;\n  padding: 3.4cqi;\n  background: var(--ds-highlight-fill);\n  border: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  border-radius: calc(1.4cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1));\n}\n.c-closing-slide .label { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-closing-slide h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 4.2cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.08;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-closing-slide .why { margin: 0; font-size: 1.7cqi; line-height: 1.45; }\n.c-closing-slide .steps { align-self: center; display: grid; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-closing-slide .steps-head { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); padding-bottom: 1.4cqi; }\n.c-closing-slide .right { align-self: center; display: grid; }\n.c-closing-slide .steps li {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 4cqi minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  align-items: center;\n  column-gap: 1.8cqi;\n  padding: 2cqi 0;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n}\n.c-closing-slide .steps li:last-child { border-bottom: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-closing-slide .n {\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  width: 3.4cqi;\n  height: 3.4cqi;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--ds-action);\n  color: var(--ds-on-action);\n  font-size: 1.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n.c-closing-slide .what { display: grid; gap: 0.3cqi; }\n.c-closing-slide .what b { font-size: 2cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-closing-slide .what span { font-size: 1.5cqi; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-closing-slide .when { font-size: 1.7cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }\n.c-closing-slide .foot {\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\n  padding-top: 1.8cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 1.4cqi;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-closing-slide .foot b { color: var(--ds-text); font-weight: 600; }",
