   "html": "<section class=\"c-two-column-slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"claim\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Our claim</div>\n      <h2>Self-serve setup will halve time to first value</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">The delay is not the product. It is the wait for someone on our side.</p>\n    </div>\n    <ol class=\"evidence\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"mark\">1</span>\n        <div><h3>Setup waits on us, not on the customer</h3><p>74% of setup time is spent waiting for a call or an email reply.</p></div>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"mark\">2</span>\n        <div><h3>The pilot already shows the effect</h3><p>Accounts in the self-serve pilot reached first value in 6 days, against 14.</p></div>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"mark\">3</span>\n        <div><h3>Support load stays flat</h3><p>Tickets per new account did not rise during the eight-week pilot.</p></div>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-two-column-slide {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-two-column-slide .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);\n  column-gap: 7cqi;\n  padding: 6cqi 7cqi;\n}\n.c-two-column-slide .claim { display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 2.2cqi; }\n.c-two-column-slide .eyebrow { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-two-column-slide h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 5cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.06;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-two-column-slide .lede { margin: 0; font-size: 1.9cqi; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 34cqi; }\n.c-two-column-slide .evidence {\n  display: grid;\n  align-content: center;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0 0 0 5cqi;\n  list-style: none;\n  border-left: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n}\n.c-two-column-slide .evidence li {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 4.4cqi minmax(0, 1fr);\n  column-gap: 2cqi;\n  padding: 2.4cqi 0;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n}\n.c-two-column-slide .evidence li:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }\n.c-two-column-slide .evidence li:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }\n.c-two-column-slide .mark {\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  width: 4.4cqi;\n  height: 4.4cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-info-line);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--ds-info-fill);\n  font-size: 1.8cqi;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-two-column-slide h3 { margin: 0 0 0.6cqi; font-size: 2.3cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-two-column-slide p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.75cqi; line-height: 1.45; }",
