   "html": "<section class=\"c-feature-grid\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Everything in the close</span>\n      <h2>One place for the work finance teams repeat every month</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Replace the checklist, the shared inbox and the reconciliation workbook with a single workflow your auditors can follow.</p>\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"grid\">\n      <li class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5.5\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>Automatic matching</h3>\n        <p>Bank lines, invoices and ledger entries pair up on amount, date and reference. You only see the exceptions.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.5\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>Approval routing</h3>\n        <p>Requests go to the right owner with a due date, and reminders stop when they sign off.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>Audit trail</h3>\n        <p>Every change is time-stamped and attributed, so a review takes an afternoon instead of a week.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 3v4M15 3v4M7 7h10v4a5 5 0 0 1-10 0z M12 16v5\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>Live connectors</h3>\n        <p>Pull from your bank, ERP and payroll without CSV exports. New data lands every hour.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 20v-7M12 20V5M19 20v-10M3 20h18\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>Variance notes</h3>\n        <p>Drafts the first explanation for every line that moved, with the source entries linked.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"item\">\n        <span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>Role-based access</h3>\n        <p>Preparers, reviewers and auditors see only what their role needs, enforced by single sign-on.</p>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-feature-grid {\n  background: var(--ds-bg);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n}\n.c-feature-grid .wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--ds-space-10) var(--ds-space-6); }\n.c-feature-grid .head { display: grid; gap: var(--ds-space-4); justify-items: center; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto var(--ds-space-9); text-align: center; }\n.c-feature-grid .eyebrow { font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-feature-grid h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: var(--ds-text-2xl);\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: var(--ds-leading-tight);\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-feature-grid .lede { font-size: var(--ds-text-lg); line-height: var(--ds-leading-snug); text-wrap: pretty; }\n.c-feature-grid .grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: var(--ds-space-5);\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n.c-feature-grid .item {\n  display: grid;\n  align-content: start;\n  gap: var(--ds-space-3);\n  padding: var(--ds-space-6);\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-lg);\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  transition: border-color var(--ds-dur-base) var(--ds-ease), box-shadow var(--ds-dur-base) var(--ds-ease), transform var(--ds-dur-base) var(--ds-ease);\n}\n.c-feature-grid .item:hover { border-color: var(--ds-muted); box-shadow: var(--ds-shadow-md); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n.c-feature-grid .icon {\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 44px;\n  margin-bottom: var(--ds-space-2);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-md);\n  background: var(--ds-panel);\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-feature-grid .icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }\n.c-feature-grid h3 { margin: 0; font-size: var(--ds-text-md); font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-feature-grid p { margin: 0; font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); line-height: var(--ds-leading-body); color: var(--ds-text); }\n@media (max-width: 960px) {\n  .c-feature-grid .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n}\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .c-feature-grid .wrap { padding: var(--ds-space-8) var(--ds-space-4); }\n  .c-feature-grid .head { margin-bottom: var(--ds-space-7); }\n  .c-feature-grid h2 { font-size: var(--ds-text-xl); }\n  .c-feature-grid .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--ds-space-3); }\n  .c-feature-grid .item { padding: var(--ds-space-5); }\n}",
