   "html": "<section class=\"c-testimonials\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Customers</span>\n      <h2>Finance teams that got their evenings back</h2>\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"grid\">\n      <li>\n        <figure class=\"card\">\n          <svg class=\"quote-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22v-8.2C4 8.6 7 5.2 12 4.5v3.6c-2.4.6-3.6 2.2-3.7 4.4H12V22zm13 0v-8.2c0-5.2 3-8.6 8-9.3v3.6c-2.4.6-3.6 2.2-3.7 4.4H25V22z\"/></svg>\n          <blockquote>Our month-end close used to take eleven working days. It now takes <b>four</b>, and the audit request list that once ate a week is a single export.</blockquote>\n          <figcaption>\n            <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">PA</span>\n            <span class=\"who\"><span class=\"name\">Priya Anand</span><span class=\"role\">Financial Controller, Brightwater Logistics</span></span>\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <figure class=\"card\">\n          <svg class=\"quote-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22v-8.2C4 8.6 7 5.2 12 4.5v3.6c-2.4.6-3.6 2.2-3.7 4.4H12V22zm13 0v-8.2c0-5.2 3-8.6 8-9.3v3.6c-2.4.6-3.6 2.2-3.7 4.4H25V22z\"/></svg>\n          <blockquote>The matching is the part that sold me. We went from checking 2,000 lines by hand to reviewing <b>about 60 exceptions</b>, and the notes explain why each one moved.</blockquote>\n          <figcaption>\n            <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TR</span>\n            <span class=\"who\"><span class=\"name\">Tomas Reyes</span><span class=\"role\">Head of Finance, Fernhill Dental Group</span></span>\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <figure class=\"card\">\n          <svg class=\"quote-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22v-8.2C4 8.6 7 5.2 12 4.5v3.6c-2.4.6-3.6 2.2-3.7 4.4H12V22zm13 0v-8.2c0-5.2 3-8.6 8-9.3v3.6c-2.4.6-3.6 2.2-3.7 4.4H25V22z\"/></svg>\n          <blockquote>I am a team of one, and Stackwell feels like hiring a careful junior. Approvals chase themselves and I can finally <b>take a Friday off</b> at quarter end.</blockquote>\n          <figcaption>\n            <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">HV</span>\n            <span class=\"who\"><span class=\"name\">Hannah Voss</span><span class=\"role\">Finance Lead, Copperline Studios</span></span>\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-testimonials {\n  background: var(--ds-bg);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n}\n.c-testimonials .wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--ds-space-10) var(--ds-space-6); }\n.c-testimonials .head { display: grid; gap: var(--ds-space-3); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto var(--ds-space-9); text-align: center; }\n.c-testimonials .eyebrow { font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-testimonials h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: var(--ds-text-2xl);\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: var(--ds-leading-tight);\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-testimonials .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--ds-space-5); margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-testimonials .grid > li { display: flex; }\n.c-testimonials .card {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--ds-space-6);\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: var(--ds-space-7) var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-6);\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-xl);\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n}\n.c-testimonials .quote-mark { width: 28px; height: 28px; color: var(--ds-line); }\n.c-testimonials blockquote { flex: 1; margin: 0; font-size: var(--ds-text-md); line-height: var(--ds-leading-body); color: var(--ds-ink); text-wrap: pretty; }\n.c-testimonials blockquote b { font-weight: 700; }\n.c-testimonials figcaption { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--ds-space-3); padding-top: var(--ds-space-5); border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-testimonials .avatar {\n  flex: none;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 44px;\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  background: var(--ds-panel);\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  font-size: var(--ds-text-sm);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n}\n.c-testimonials .who { display: grid; line-height: var(--ds-leading-snug); }\n.c-testimonials .name { font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-testimonials .role { font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); color: var(--ds-muted); text-wrap: balance; }\n@media (max-width: 960px) {\n  .c-testimonials .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .c-testimonials .wrap { padding: var(--ds-space-8) var(--ds-space-4); }\n  .c-testimonials .head { margin-bottom: var(--ds-space-7); }\n  .c-testimonials h2 { font-size: var(--ds-text-xl); }\n  .c-testimonials .card { padding: var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-5) var(--ds-space-5); }\n}",
