   "html": "<figure class=\"c-pull-quote\">\n  <div class=\"quote\">\n    <svg class=\"mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 28\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 28V16.4C0 6.6 5 1.2 14.2 0l1.4 4.6C10.8 6 8.6 8.8 8.4 12.4H15V28H0Zm21 0V16.4C21 6.6 26 1.2 35.2 0l.8 4.6C31.8 6 29.6 8.8 29.4 12.4H36V28H21Z\"/></svg>\n    <blockquote>\n      <p class=\"text\">We stopped arguing about whose numbers were right and started arguing about what to do with them. That alone saved us two meetings a week.</p>\n    </blockquote>\n    <figcaption>\n      <span class=\"who\">Operations Director</span>\n      <span class=\"role\">Regional logistics client, interviewed 14 October 2026</span>\n    </figcaption>\n  </div>\n</figure>",
   "css": ".c-pull-quote {\n  padding: var(--ds-space-8) var(--ds-space-7);\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-xl);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n}\n.c-pull-quote .quote {\n  position: relative;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  max-width: 760px;\n  padding-left: var(--ds-space-7);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--ds-neutral-line);\n}\n.c-pull-quote .mark { display: block; width: 36px; height: 28px; margin-bottom: var(--ds-space-4); color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-pull-quote blockquote { margin: 0; }\n.c-pull-quote .text {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: clamp(22px, 3.2vw, 34px);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.28;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: pretty;\n}\n.c-pull-quote figcaption { display: grid; gap: 2px; margin-top: var(--ds-space-5); font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); }\n.c-pull-quote .who { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-pull-quote .role { color: var(--ds-muted); }\n@media (max-width: 560px) {\n  .c-pull-quote { padding: var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-4); }\n  .c-pull-quote .quote { padding-left: var(--ds-space-5); }\n}",
